    "turn_text": "It's even worse than that. They're hiding the facts. They do know the facts. They know who the people are and they know which companies they got the money from. But when in open secrets organization, a nonprofit asked them, they refused to give it, and then the nonprofit got the information on Freedom of Information Act. And what they found was 1,800 doctors got 193 million.",
