      },
      {
        "text": "Secrecy about vaccine distribution undermines trust in institutions.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes they have been misled by authorities regarding the policy.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Public awareness of who receives medical benefits is necessary for fairness.",
